config BR2_PACKAGE_AXERA_OSDRV_AX620E
	bool "axera-osdrv-ax620e"
	help
	  Axera AX620E (AX630C/AX620E, Cortex-A53) kernel modules. VIN/CSI2
	  capture, the VC8000E encoder and Hantro decoder, and EIP-130
	  crypto build from source as part of the axera-ax620e kernel
	  branch; the ISP 3A (ax_proton.ko), NPU (ax_npu.ko) and the rest of
	  the vendor codec stack are closed binaries shipped in this
	  package at kernel 5.15.73's vermagic. See this package's README
	  for provenance.
